1
00:00:00,060 --> 00:00:05,873
The books say a thousand units. The year-end count finds nine hundred and forty.

2
00:00:05,993 --> 00:00:09,268
Which number goes in the accounts?

3
00:00:11,788 --> 00:00:14,920
Usually the count, once it's checked.

4
00:00:15,040 --> 00:00:18,542
Then find out why 60 are missing.

5
00:00:18,662 --> 00:00:21,100
Sold but not booked out.

6
00:00:21,220 --> 00:00:24,252
Received but not booked in.

7
00:00:24,372 --> 00:00:27,611
Damage or loss not recorded.

8
00:00:27,731 --> 00:00:34,307
Our accounting & MIS advisory reconciles the two.

9
00:00:34,427 --> 00:00:39,591
Counting stock? Message us.
